  "name": "Cajun Turkey Salad with Guacamole",
  "subtitle": "Spiced turkey, crisp pepper, herbs, and tortilla chips",
  "description": "A warm Cajun-seasoned turkey salad finished with guacamole, toasted sesame, and crunchy tortilla chips.",
